0000:                   ********************************************************************
0000:                   * Asm - 6809/6309 Assembler
0000:                   *
0000:                   * ASM V1.6 - Microware version - 6309 instruction assembly by
0000:                   *  L. Curtis Boyle
0000:                   *
0000:                   * Obtained by Boisy Pitre from L. Curtis Boyle on 10/12/2002
0000:                   *
0000:                   * $Id$
0000:                   *
0000:                   * Edt/Rev  YYYY/MM/DD  Modified by
0000:                   * Comment
0000:                   * ------------------------------------------------------------------
0000:                   *   6      1999/05/11  Boisy G. Pitre
0000:                   * Made compliant with 1900-2155.
0000:                   *
0000:                   *   7      2003/06/27  Rodney V. Hamilton
0000:                   * Added 6309 bitfield instructions.
0000:                   *
0000:                   *   8      2003/07/28  Rodney V. Hamilton
0000:                   * Enabled underscore and lowercase in symbols.
0000:                   *
0000:                   *   9      2004/03/20  Rodney V. Hamilton
0000:                   * Added support for LDQ immediate, TFM register modes
0000:                   * Copied the W indexed addressing code from ASM6309
0000:                   * 0-register bug fixed, TFR now accepts R16->R8 xfers
0000:                   * Added new IFDEF/IFNDF conditionals
0000:                   *
0000:                   *  10      2004/06/15  Rodney V. Hamilton
0000:                   * Arbitrary-length labels allowed. (first 8 chars must be unique)
0000:                   * Listing buffer overruns prevented. Opt W linewidth now 132 max.
0000:                   * 6309 Reg2Reg ops now allow R16->R8 xfers. (sets warning flag)
0000:                   * Listing fields spaced correctly, comment field auto-aligned.
0000:                   *
0000:                   *  10r1    2004/07/31  Rodney V. Hamilton
0000:                   * Added "@" as valid symbol char. (but no local label support)
0000:                   *
0000:                   *  11      2019/03/25-2019/04/14  L. Curtis Boyle
0000:                   * Minor optimizations, -O= will overwrite existing output file
0000:                   * Expanded source line max length to 127 - I think it may work up to 132 fine (not tested)
0000:                   * 6309 specific optimazations as well
0000:                   
0000:                            nam   Asm
0000:                            ttl   6809/6309 Assembler
0000:                   
0000:                          ifp1
0000:                   *         use   /dd/defs/deffile
0000:                            use   defsfile
0000:                          endc
