0011:                   tylg     set   Prgrm+Objct
0081:                   atrv     set   ReEnt+rev
0001:                   rev      set   $01
000B:                   edition  set   11             11 adds -o doing overwrite (I hope)
0001:                   DOCASE   equ   1              enable case-sensitive symbols
0001:                   NEWDEF   equ   1              enable IFDEF/IFNDF conditionals
0084:                   InBufSiz equ   132            max size of source line read buffer (originally 120)
